#131731=PRODUCT('PRT - 9021 - CAMTARXIA - V04',
'PRT - 9021 - CAMTARXIA - V04',
'Camera target for the XIAO ESP32-S3 Sense: hangs in an openUC2 cube f
rom the top (cap on four corner bosses), camera module in a square sea
t on the cube axis, board slid in from the back, USB-C from the top. F
DM, print upside down on the cap, no supports. Magnets 8x3: 2 front, 2
 foot.',(#131727));
#131732=PRODUCT('PRT - 9022 - CAMTARCOV - V04',
'PRT - 9022 - CAMTARCOV - V04',
'Back cover of the camera target: slides down through the cap into the
 side-wall slots and presses the board forward with two ribs. FDM, pri
nt flat, ribs up.',(#131727));
